OL,3,GNEWSAMurder victim's family 'deserve
OL,4,Aanswers' as killer remains at large
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's justice minister has
OL,7,Fbeen asked to meet the family of a man
OL,8,Fmurdered in Londonderry, whose killer
OL,9,Fhas been on the run for four days.
OL,11,FGary Anderson, 29, who is one of two
OL,12,Fbrothers jailed for life for the murder
OL,13,Fof Karol Kelly in Londonderry in 2018,
OL,14,Ffailed to return to Maghaberry prison
OL,15,Fon Monday.
OL,17,FA court granted Anderson compassionate
OL,18,Ftemporary release (CTR) to attend his
OL,19,Ffather's funeral in Derry, despite
OL,20,Fopposition from prison authorities.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
